{"unit_id":"Sunday2Mo__dsh-file-quote#caveat-1","repo":"Sunday2Mo/dsh-file-quote","commit":"7656008c00227c974e4c5ef0086b68105702d77f","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-file-quote 使用前须知：文件原文浮层只读取工作区内不超过 2 MiB 的文本文件，二进制文件不支持；文件内容由本地 DSH Web 路由返回。见 src/index.js:70-101","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:70-101"]}
